  "description": "Tae-Hui, who lost her husband and runs a Chinese restaurant alone spends her days comforting her empty heart with pet toys. Then, she meets Seong-Chan, who was about to jump off the bridge her husband died from. Their chance encounter leads them to live together, but Tae-Hui finds herself drawn to Seong-Chan, who resembles her husband...\n\n *\"I like you, sir, but do you really not like me?\"*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note:\n\\- Includes two extra chapters.\n\\- 14th Mr. Blue Contest Short Story Winner.*",
